# Run Vercel CLI from the repository root; the linked project builds web/.
# Only the web product and its serverless API are deployment inputs.
/*
!web

# Database tooling, QA fixtures and local data never belong in a web deployment.
/web/backend
/web/qa
/web/scripts
**/*.test.js
**/.env*
**/*.log
**/node_modules
/web/dist
/web/.vercel
